    "description": "Phishing keyword and phrase dictionary for detection, triage, and security-awareness research. Single-word, multi-word, and common variants. Intended for defensive use: SIEM/email-gateway rule seeding, lexical features for ML classifiers, and awareness training. Lexical matching alone is weak against modern AI-generated/polymorphic phishing — combine with sender/domain analysis, URL/attachment inspection, and behavioral anomaly detection.",
