      "Expel top phishing keywords (10k+ investigated emails)",
      "Hoxhunt 2025/2026 Threat Intelligence & Phishing Trends reports",
      "Microsoft Email threat landscape Q1 2026 (Tycoon2FA, quishing, HTML attachments)",
      "APWG / Zscaler ThreatLabz / Verizon DBIR 2025 / IBM X-Force 2025 trends"
    ],
    "usage_notes": [
      "Match case-insensitively; normalize unicode and strip zero-width/invisible chars before matching (polymorphic evasion).",
      "Weight categories rather than treating any single hit as malicious — generic business terms (invoice, document, file) have high false-positive rates in legitimate mail.",
      "Subject-line hits + blank subjects + display-name/domain mismatch is a stronger signal than body keywords alone.",
      "Modern AI-generated phish often strips flagged brand/keyword terms entirely; absence of keywords is not absence of threat."
    ]
